#: ../../source/reference/learn/generated/maxframe.learn.preprocessing.OneHotEncoder.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.learn.preprocessing.OneHotEncoder"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.learn.preprocessing._encoders.OneHotEncoder:1 of
msgid "Encode categorical features as a one-hot numeric array."
msgstr "将分类特征编码为 one-hot 数值数组。"

#: maxframe.learn.preprocessing._encoders.OneHotEncoder:3 of
msgid ""
"The input to this transformer should be an array-like of integers or "
"strings, denoting the values taken on by categorical (discrete) features."
" The features are encoded using a one-hot (aka 'one-of-K' or 'dummy') "
"encoding scheme. This creates a binary column for each category and "
"returns a sparse matrix or dense array (depending on the "
"``sparse_output`` parameter)."
msgstr ""
"此转换器的输入应该是整数或字符串的类数组，表示分类（离散）特征所采用的值"
"。特征使用 one-hot（也称为 'one-of-K' 或 'dummy'）编码方案进行编码。这会"
"为每个类别创建一个二进制列，并返回稀疏矩阵或密集数组（取决于 ``sparse_"
"output`` 参数）。"

#: maxframe.learn.preprocessing._encoders.OneHotEncoder:10 of
msgid ""
"By default, the input is expected to be an array of integers or strings. "
"If categorical features are represented as numeric data, you can use "
"``categories='auto'`` to infer the categories from the training data."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，输入应为整数或字符串数组。如果分类特征表示为数值数据，您可以"
"使用 ``categories='auto'`` 从训练数据中推断类别。"

#: ../../source/reference/learn/generated/maxframe.learn.preprocessing.OneHotEncoder.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.learn.preprocessing._encoders.OneHotEncoder:14 of
msgid ""
"Categories (unique values) per feature:  - 'auto' : Determine categories "
"automatically from the training data. - list : ``categories[i]`` holds "
"the categories expected in the ith   column. The passed categories should"
" not mix strings and numeric   values within a single feature, and should"
" be sorted in case of   numeric values."
msgstr ""
"每个特征的类别（唯一值）： - 'auto' : 从训练数据中自动确定类别。 - list :"
" ``categories[i]`` 包含第 i 列中预期的类别。传递的类别不应在单个特征中"
"混合字符串和数值，并且在数值情况下应进行排序。"

#: maxframe.learn.preprocessing._encoders.OneHotEncoder:14 of
msgid "Categories (unique values) per feature:"
msgstr "每个特征的类别（唯一值）："

#: maxframe.learn.preprocessing._encoders.OneHotEncoder:16 of
msgid "'auto' : Determine categories automatically from the training data."
msgstr "'auto' : 从训练数据中自动确定类别。"

#: maxframe.learn.preprocessing._encoders.OneHotEncoder:17 of
msgid ""
"list : ``categories[i]`` holds the categories expected in the ith column."
" The passed categories should not mix strings and numeric values within a"
" single feature, and should be sorted in case of numeric values."
msgstr ""
"list : ``categories[i]`` 包含第 i 列中预期的类别。传递的类别不应在单个"
"特征中混合字符串和数值，并且在数值情况下应进行排序。"

#: maxframe.learn.preprocessing._encoders.OneHotEncoder:22 of
msgid ""
"Specifies a methodology to use to drop one of the categories per feature."
" This is useful in situations where perfectly collinear features cause "
"problems, such as when feeding the resulting data into an unregularized "
"linear regression model.  However, dropping one category breaks the "
"symmetry of the original representation and can therefore induce a bias "
"in downstream models, for instance for penalized linear classification or"
" regression models.  - None : retain all features (the default). - "
"'first' : drop the first category in each feature. - 'if_binary' : drop "
"the first category in each feature with two   categories. Features with 1"
" or more than 2 categories are   left intact. - array : ``drop[i]`` is "
"the category in feature ``X[:, i]`` that   should be dropped."
msgstr ""
"指定用于删除每个特征中一个类别的方法。在完全共线性特征引起问题的情况下，"
"这很有用，例如将结果数据输入未正则化的线性回归模型时。但是，删除一个类别"
"会破坏原始表示的对称性，因此可能在下游模型中引入偏差，例如对于惩罚线性"
"分类或回归模型。 - None : 保留所有特征（默认值）。 - 'first' : 删除每个"
"特征中的第一个类别。 - 'if_binary' : 删除每个有两个类别的特征中的第一个"
"类别。具有 1 个或超过 2 个类别的特征保持不变。 - array : ``drop[i]`` 是"
"特征 ``X[:, i]`` 中应该删除的类别。"

#: maxframe.learn.preprocessing._encoders.OneHotEncoder:22 of
msgid ""
"Specifies a methodology to use to drop one of the categories per feature."
" This is useful in situations where perfectly collinear features cause "
"problems, such as when feeding the resulting data into an unregularized "
"linear regression model."
msgstr ""
"指定用于删除每个特征中一个类别的方法。在完全共线性特征引起问题的情况下，"
"这很有用，例如将结果数据输入未正则化的线性回归模型时。"

#: maxframe.learn.preprocessing._encoders.OneHotEncoder:27 of
msgid ""
"However, dropping one category breaks the symmetry of the original "
"representation and can therefore induce a bias in downstream models, for "
"instance for penalized linear classification or regression models."
msgstr ""
"但是，删除一个类别会破坏原始表示的对称性，因此可能在下游模型中引入偏差，"
"例如对于惩罚线性分类或回归模型。"

#: maxframe.learn.preprocessing._encoders.OneHotEncoder:31 of
msgid "None : retain all features (the default)."
msgstr "None : 保留所有特征（默认值）。"

#: maxframe.learn.preprocessing._encoders.OneHotEncoder:32 of
msgid "'first' : drop the first category in each feature."
msgstr "'first' : 删除每个特征中的第一个类别。"

#: maxframe.learn.preprocessing._encoders.OneHotEncoder:33 of
msgid ""
"'if_binary' : drop the first category in each feature with two "
"categories. Features with 1 or more than 2 categories are left intact."
msgstr ""
"'if_binary' : 删除每个有两个类别的特征中的第一个类别。具有 1 个或超过 2 "
"个类别的特征保持不变。"

#: maxframe.learn.preprocessing._encoders.OneHotEncoder:36 of
msgid ""
"array : ``drop[i]`` is the category in feature ``X[:, i]`` that should be"
" dropped."
msgstr "array : ``drop[i]`` 是特征 ``X[:, i]`` 中应该删除的类别。"

#: maxframe.learn.preprocessing._encoders.OneHotEncoder:39 of
msgid "When True, returns a sparse matrix. When False, returns a dense array."
msgstr "当为 True 时，返回稀疏矩阵。当为 False 时，返回密集数组。"

#: maxframe.learn.preprocessing._encoders.OneHotEncoder:41 of
msgid "Desired dtype of output."
msgstr "输出的期望数据类型。"

#: maxframe.learn.preprocessing._encoders.OneHotEncoder:43 of
msgid ""
"Specifies the way unknown categories are handled during "
":meth:`transform`.  - 'error' : Raise an error if an unknown category is "
"encountered. - 'ignore' : When an unknown category is encountered, the "
"resulting   one-hot encoded columns for this feature will be all zeros."
msgstr ""
"指定在 :meth:`transform` 期间处理未知类别的方式。 - 'error' : 遇到未知"
"类别时引发错误。 - 'ignore' : 遇到未知类别时，该特征的结果 one-hot 编码列"
"将全部为零。"

#: maxframe.learn.preprocessing._encoders.OneHotEncoder:43 of
msgid "Specifies the way unknown categories are handled during :meth:`transform`."
msgstr "指定在 :meth:`transform` 期间处理未知类别的方式。"

#: maxframe.learn.preprocessing._encoders.OneHotEncoder:45 of
msgid "'error' : Raise an error if an unknown category is encountered."
msgstr "'error' : 遇到未知类别时引发错误。"

#: maxframe.learn.preprocessing._encoders.OneHotEncoder:46 of
msgid ""
"'ignore' : When an unknown category is encountered, the resulting one-hot"
" encoded columns for this feature will be all zeros."
msgstr "'ignore' : 遇到未知类别时，该特征的结果 one-hot 编码列将全部为零。"

#: maxframe.learn.preprocessing._encoders.OneHotEncoder:52 of
msgid ""
"The categories of each feature determined during fitting (in order of the"
" features in X and corresponding with the output of ``transform``). This "
"includes the category specified in ``drop`` (if any)."
msgstr ""
"拟合期间确定的每个特征的类别（按照 X 中特征的顺序，并与 ``transform`` 的"
"输出相对应）。这包括 ``drop`` 中指定的类别（如果有）。"

#: maxframe.learn.preprocessing._encoders.OneHotEncoder of
msgid "type"
msgstr "类型"

#: maxframe.learn.preprocessing._encoders.OneHotEncoder:57 of
msgid "list of arrays"
msgstr "数组列表"

#: maxframe.learn.preprocessing._encoders.OneHotEncoder:63 of
msgid ""
"``drop_idx_[i]`` is the index in ``categories_[i]`` of the category to be"
" dropped for each feature."
msgstr "``drop_idx_[i]`` 是每个特征要删除的类别在 ``categories_[i]`` 中的索引。"

#: maxframe.learn.preprocessing._encoders.OneHotEncoder:65 of
msgid ""
"``drop_idx_[i] = None`` if no category is to be dropped from the feature "
"with index ``i``, e.g. when `drop='if_binary'` and the feature isn't "
"binary."
msgstr ""
"如果索引为 ``i`` 的特征不需要删除任何类别，则 ``drop_idx_[i] = None``，"
"例如当 `drop='if_binary'` 且特征不是二元的时。"

#: maxframe.learn.preprocessing._encoders.OneHotEncoder:68 of
msgid "``drop_idx_ = None`` if all the transformed features will be retained."
msgstr "如果将保留所有转换后的特征，则 ``drop_idx_ = None``。"

#: maxframe.learn.preprocessing._encoders.OneHotEncoder:71 of
msgid "array of shape (n_features,)"
msgstr "形状为 (n_features,) 的数组"

#: maxframe.learn.preprocessing._encoders.OneHotEncoder:75 of
msgid "Number of features seen during :term:`fit`."
msgstr "在 :term:`fit` 期间看到的特征数量。"

